msgstr "JOC %s"

msgid "RUN WITH"
msgstr "EXECUTA AMB"

msgid ""
"Welcome to RECALBOX for Odroid Go Super!\n"
"This little presentation will show you how to use all the special buttons "
"available all around the screen.\n"
"\n"
"Press any button to start!"
msgstr ""
"Benvinguts a RECALBOX per a Odroid Go Super!\n"
"Aquesta petita presentació us mostrarà com utilitzar tots els botons "
"especials disponibles al voltant de la pantalla.\n"
"\n"
"Premeu qualsevol botó per començar!"

msgid ""
"The top-left black button is the SELECT button, also available on most "
"modern pads.\n"
"But it is also the HOTKEY button that you can use in conjunction with other "
"buttons in most emulators.\n"
"For example, you can use HOTKEY+START to quit the current game.\n"
"\n"
"Press the SELECT button."
msgstr ""
"El botó negre a la part superior esquerra és el botó SELECT, també "
"disponible a la majoria de comandaments moderns.\n"
"Però també és el botó HOTKEY que podeu utilitzar juntament amb altres botons "
"a la majoria d'emuladors.\n"
"Per exemple, podeu utilitzar HOTKEY+START per sortir del joc actual.\n"
"\n"
"Premeu el botó SELECT."

msgid ""
"At the opposite side of the SELECT button is the START button.\n"
"Use it to open the main menu in the Recalbox interface and use it in-game as "
"the regular START button available on most consoles.\n"
"\n"
"Press this START button please."
msgstr ""
"Al costat oposat del botó SELECT hi ha el botó START.\n"
"Utilitzeu-lo per obrir el menú principal a la interfície de Recalbox i "
"utilitzeu-lo al joc com el botó START habitual disponible a la majoria de "
"consoles.\n"
"\n"
"Premeu aquest botó START si us plau."

msgid ""
"Then, on the top of the console, there are 2 buttons marked with a '-' and a "
"'+'.\n"
"Use them to raise or lower the volume at any time in the Recalbox interface "
"or in-game.\n"
"\n"
" Press any button to continue"
msgstr ""
"A continuació, a la part superior de la consola, hi ha 2 botons marcats amb "
"'-' i '+'.\n"
"Utilitzeu-los per pujar o baixar el volum en qualsevol moment a la "
"interfície de Recalbox o al joc.\n"
"\n"
" Premeu qualsevol botó per continuar"

msgid ""
"The two bottom-left gray buttons control the screen brightness.\n"
"Note that the brighter the screen, the more power it consumes!\n"
"\n"
" Press either brightness up or down button"
msgstr ""
"Els dos botons grisos a la part inferior esquerra controlen la brillantor de "
"la pantalla.\n"
"Tingueu en compte que com més brillant sigui la pantalla, més energia "
"consumeix!\n"
"\n"
" Premeu el botó de pujar o baixar la brillantor"

msgid ""
"Finally, the two bottom-right gray buttons are third left & right triggers "
"(L3/R3), only usefull in some emulators or to record videos.\n"
"\n"
" Press either L3 or R3"
msgstr ""
"Finalment, els dos botons grisos a la part inferior dreta són els tercers "
"gallets esquerre i dret (L3/R3), útils només en alguns emuladors o per "
"gravar vídeos.\n"
"\n"
" Premeu L3 o R3"

msgid ""
"Change the driver if your pad is not working at all or not working properly "
"in-game."
msgstr ""
"Canvieu el controlador si el vostre comandament no funciona en absolut o no "
"funciona correctament dins del joc."

