"funcions exclusives estan disponibles!"

msgid ""
"Hello %NAME%, your private key is linked to a Patreon account which is no "
"longer a Recalbox Patron.\n"
"We still hope to see you back soon as a Recalbox Patron!\n"
"Delete your private key to suppress this message."
msgstr ""
"Hola %NAME%, la vostra clau privada està vinculada a un compte de Patreon "
"que ja no és mecenes de Recalbox.\n"
"Encara esperem tornar a veure-us aviat com a mecenes de Recalbox!\n"
"Suprimiu la vostra clau privada per eliminar aquest missatge."

msgid ""
"Your private key does not allow to retrieve your Patreon information. Go to "
"recalbox.com/patreon to generate a new valid key!"
msgstr ""
"La vostra clau privada no permet recuperar la vostra informació de Patreon. "
"Aneu a recalbox.com/patreon per generar una nova clau vàlida!"

msgid ""
"Sorry we're not able to retrieve your Patron level because no network is "
"available!"
msgstr ""
"Ho sentim, no podem recuperar el vostre nivell de mecenes perquè no hi ha "
"cap xarxa disponible!"

msgid ""
"We're not able to retrieve your Patron level! Sorry for the inconvenience, "
"we're already working on a fix!"
msgstr ""
"No podem recuperar el vostre nivell de mecenes! Sentim les molèsties, ja "
"estem treballant en una solució!"

msgid "CASE MANAGEMENT"
msgstr "GESTIÓ DE LA CARCASSA"

msgid ""
"If you installed a case on your Recalbox, you can install or uninstall it in "
"this menu. Some cases are detected automatically and will also be reported "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Si heu instal·lat una carcassa al vostre Recalbox, podeu instal·lar-la o "
"desinstal·lar-la aquí. Algunes carcasses es detecten automàticament i també "
"es mostraran aquí."

msgid ""
"The USB device %NAME% with no rom folder and no share folder has been "
"plugged in! Would you like to initialize this device?"
msgstr ""
"S'ha connectat el dispositiu USB %NAME% sense carpeta de roms ni carpeta "
"share! Voleu inicialitzar aquest dispositiu?"

msgid "• Choose '%INIT%' to create only all the rom folders"
msgstr "• Trieu '%INIT%' per crear només totes les carpetes de roms"

msgid ""
"• Choose '%MOVE%' to copy all the current share to the new device, "
"automatically switch to this device, and reboot"
msgstr ""
"• Trieu '%MOVE%' per copiar tot el share actual al dispositiu nou, canviar "
"automàticament a aquest dispositiu i reiniciar"

msgid "• Or just chose '%CANCEL%' to do nothing with this new device"
msgstr ""
"• O simplement trieu '%CANCEL%' per no fer res amb aquest dispositiu nou"

