msgstr "INICIALITZA"

msgid "MOVE SHARE"
msgstr "MOU EL SHARE"

msgid "Setting up boot device..."
msgstr "Configurant el dispositiu d'arrencada..."

msgid ""
"Your USB device has been initialized! Ready to reboot on your new share "
"device!"
msgstr ""
"El vostre dispositiu USB s'ha inicialitzat! Llest per reiniciar amb el "
"vostre nou dispositiu share!"

msgid "UPDATING..."
msgstr "ACTUALITZANT..."

msgid "Video"
msgstr "Vídeo"

msgid ""
"For safe shutdown to work, set the SAFE SHUTDOWN switch to ON. You will find "
"it on the circuit board, inside your Retroflag case."
msgstr ""
