msgid ""
"Your controller has __no SELECT or HOTKEY button__. The START button will be "
"used for special actions:\n"
"- **Long press on START** = quit the game (START + HOTKEY)\n"
"- **START + Validate** = SELECT (insert credit in arcade games)\n"
"- **START + any other button** = HOTKEY + that button"
msgstr ""
"El vostre comandament __no té botó SELECT ni HOTKEY__. El botó START "
"s'utilitzarà per a accions especials:\n"
"- **Pressió llarga a START** = sortir del joc (START + HOTKEY)\n"
"- **START + Validar** = SELECT (inserir crèdit als jocs arcade)\n"
"- **START + qualsevol altre botó** = HOTKEY + aquest botó"

